      "source": "DeFiHackLabs",
      "text": "Price Oracle Manipulation. Lost: 2.2K USD"
    },
    {
      "source": "RevertIQ",
      "text": "On 15 June 2025, FixedTokenBSwap on Ethereum Mainnet suffered a $2,200 loss due to oracle manipulation. The attacker deployed a fake token and pair, exploited a vulnerable swap contract’s reliance on spot price quotes from Uniswap V2, and drained RTV tokens by bypassing a one-swap-per-address restriction. The FixedTokenBSwap contract trusted user-supplied swap paths and Uniswap V2's spot price (getAmountsIn), without verifying token authenticity or using manipulation-resistant price oracles. This allowed an attacker to create a fake token and pair, inflate input prices, and drain RTV rewards with helper contracts."
    }
